                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/12.1.3"&gt;12.1.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Handle &lt;code&gt;DataValidationError&lt;/code&gt; notifications returned by &lt;code&gt;ConvertBack&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Evan260/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Evan260"&gt;@Evan260&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5379312949" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22171" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22171/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22171"&gt;#22171&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Make word segmentation linear in the length of a regional indicator run by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5395276594" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22197" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22197/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22197"&gt;#22197&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Implement &lt;code&gt;TopLevel.OpenedPopups&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5258208657" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22074" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22074/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22074"&gt;#22074&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Ignore child margins when positioning a popup by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4976201256" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21856" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21856/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21856"&gt;#21856&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Add &lt;code&gt;TableViewColumn.IsVisible&lt;/code&gt; property by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/OleRoss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/OleRoss"&gt;@OleRoss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5372574170" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22162" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22162/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22162"&gt;#22162&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Support shell virtual files in drag and drop by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/YoshihiroIto/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/YoshihiroIto"&gt;@YoshihiroIto&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5031526493" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21907" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21907/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21907"&gt;#21907&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headless – Enable popups by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5014251285" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21889" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21889/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21889"&gt;#21889&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headless – Use &lt;code&gt;MouseDevice.Primary&lt;/code&gt; for consistency with desktop platforms in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5180643633" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22008" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22008/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22008"&gt;#22008&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headless – Add touch input simulation by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5275914770" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22084" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22084/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22084"&gt;#22084&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
