&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;AssemblyDescriptorResolver.GetAssembly&lt;/code&gt; to not throw &lt;code&gt;CultureNotFoundException&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/AhtenYa/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/AhtenYa"&gt;@AhtenYa&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5339778347" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22137" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22137/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22137"&gt;#22137&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
